| path | contents |
|---|---|
| `analysis/` | calibrated Shai scorer, annealing search, and audit/analysis entry points; iteration scripts are under `analysis/legacy/` |
| `corpus/` | English Shai frequencies and raw source (`corpus/shai/`), plus Spanish frequencies (`corpus/spanish/`) |
| `findings/` | research notes, round reports, full investigation report, and 12-analyzer comparison |
